NOTICE:  sift_col index "pt_r": point_tid_columns lists the heap addresses of the rows
DETAIL:  A lookup of the access method returns the addresses without reading a unit, except for a unit with a dead row; the segments are column format minor 16 (a library before 3.3 cannot read them) and the build takes about 65% longer than without a directory.
HINT:  Drop the option, or set sift.col_format_minor to 14, to list the rows of the segment instead.
SELECT count(*) AS commands FROM sift.upgrade_commands() WHERE reason ~ 'point_tid_columns';
 commands 
